      "reasons": [
        "The packet supports that “perceived reality” relates to “information sources” and “manner of their processing,” but it does not explicitly support the wording that it is a person’s “experienced version of what is real.”",
        "The claim that it is “more strongly related to depression than some objective or directly measurable conditions” is only partially supported: the packet compares perceived reality vs “tangible reality” using specific correlational comparisons (poor self-reported health vs intrinsic health limitations), without establishing a general “objective or directly measurable conditions” distinction."
